msgid "图像、字体与许可资产"
msgstr "Images, fonts, and licensed assets"

msgid "来源资产"
msgstr "Source assets"

msgid ""
"resources/build-art 中 BMP 为可编辑的规范应用、按钮和游戏资产。 生产图像按组件选择复制，不从旧 build 目录或已移除渲染器恢复。 "
"字体变换由数据工具处理；不要把生成产物作为唯一源码。"
msgstr ""
"BMP files in resources/build-art are the editable canonical application, button, and game assets. "
"Production images are copied according to component selection, not recovered from old build "
"directories or removed renderers. Data tools handle font transformations; generated output must "
"not be the only source."

msgid ""
"STIX Two Math 原字体、来源摘要与 OFL 原文保留在 resources/licenses/reliefmath。 中文显示使用系统字体，许可与归属不能因文档清理而移除。 第三方 "
"COPYING、LICENSE、NOTICE 与上游说明保持原文。"
msgstr ""
"Original STIX Two Math fonts, provenance digests, and original OFL text remain in "
"resources/licenses/reliefmath. Chinese display uses system fonts; documentation cleanup must not "
"remove licenses or attribution. Third-party COPYING, LICENSE, NOTICE, and upstream notes retain "
"their original text."
